    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4141" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">a-sterno</span></b>  (better <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adst-</span></b> ), ĕre, v. a.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to strew
			upon;</i> hence, mid., <i>to stretch one's self</i>,
				<i>to lie stretched</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adsternunturque sepulchro,</span>”
				<i>they prostrate themselves upon</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 343</span></i>
			.</div>
